(7716245, 1268663, 103142, '<td valign="top">The first time I saw this I thought it was kind of interesting. But now Im really liking it. I wouldve been tempted to crop it in from the  right, but that wouldve been a mistake. The black area on the right actually adds to it. I wouldve cloned out the few dirty spots on the window, however. because the colors in the background are wonderful. Actually, looking at it I wouldve just gotten rid of the one white one. It draws the eyes too much. -8-</td>', 'The first time I saw this I thought it was kind of interesting. But now Im really liking it. I wouldve been tempted to crop it in from the  right, but that wouldve been a mistake. The black area on the right actually adds to it. I wouldve cloned out the few dirty spots on the window, however. because the colors in the background are wonderful. Actually, looking at it I wouldve just gotten rid of the one white one. It draws the eyes too much. -8-', '2022-03-08 17:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
